    "body": "LGTM! @annevk want to take a look? Otherwise I'll merge tomorrow.\r\n\r\nFollowups (for me, not you):\r\n\r\n- Define \"schemelessly same site\" for sites, and redefine \"schemelessly same site\" for origins in terms of it, in a similar way.\r\n- Define tuple items for \"scheme\" and \"host\" and use them throughout. (E.g. it's weird that we talk about A's host, a tuple item, but link to concept-host, a type definition.)",
